{"title":"Lemon Tree","artist":"Fools Garden","sourceId":"reference:qGUnUMp4MtZOqSTFC1qE","sourceHash":"55bcb4e8cd2c9e0fa7bebf9b3ee4472965934d671e040ef330309ccae5620635","performanceStatus":"no_performance_record","timingMethod":"reference_lrc_unverified","reviewStatus":"draft","cue_timing_confirmed":false,"timingWarning":"(주의) 노래와 함께 타이밍 검증되지 않았음","cues":[{"id":"1","start":13.22,"end":16.22,"text":"I'm sitting here in the boring room","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":17.32,"end":20.32,"text":"It's just another rainy Sunday afternoon","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":20.43,"end":23.43,"text":"I'm wasting my time, I got nothing to do","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":23.78,"end":26.73,"text":"I'm hanging around, I'm waiting for you","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":26.73,"end":29.73,"text":"But nothing ever happens, and I wonder","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":33.7,"end":36.7,"text":"I'm driving around in my car","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":37.02,"end":40.02,"text":"I'm driving too fast, I'm driving too far","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":40.43,"end":43.43,"text":"I'd like to change my point of view","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":43.78,"end":46.78,"text":"I feel so lonely, I'm waiting for you","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":46.87,"end":49.87,"text":"But nothing ever happens, and I wonder","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":53.55,"end":55.49,"text":"I wonder how","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":55.49,"end":57.13,"text":"I wonder why","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":57.13,"end":60.13,"text":"Yesterday you told me 'bout the blue, blue sky","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":60.27,"end":63.27,"text":"And all that I can see is just another lemon tree","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":67.06,"end":70.06,"text":"I'm turning my head up and down","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":70.65,"end":73.65,"text":"I'm turning, turning, turning, turning, turning around","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":73.93,"end":76.93,"text":"And all that I can see is just another lemon tree","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":79.36,"end":80.25,"text":"Sing!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":80.25,"end":83.25,"text":"Dap-dadada-dadpm-didap-da","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":85.41,"end":88.41,"text":"Dadada-dadpm-didap-da","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":88.69,"end":91.69,"text":"Dap-didili-da","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":93.24000000000001,"end":96.24000000000001,"text":"I'm sitting here, I miss the power","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":96.78999999999999,"end":99.78999999999999,"text":"I'd like to go out, taking a shower","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":100.03,"end":103.03,"text":"But there's a heavy cloud inside my head","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":103.3,"end":106.15,"text":"I feel so tired, put myself into bed","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":106.15,"end":109.15,"text":"Well, nothing ever happens, and I wonder","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":113.33,"end":116.33,"text":"Isolation is not good for me","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":120.37,"end":123.37,"text":"Isolation, well, I don't want to sit on the lemon tree","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":126.32,"end":129.32,"text":"I'm steppin' around in the desert of joy","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":129.32,"end":132.32,"text":"Baby, anyhow I'll get another toy","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":132.36,"end":135.36,"text":"And everything will happen, and you wonder","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":139.4,"end":140.63,"text":"I wonder how","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":140.63,"end":142.56,"text":"I wonder why","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"34","start":142.56,"end":145.56,"text":"Yesterday you told me 'bout the blue, blue sky","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"35","start":145.64,"end":148.64,"text":"And all that I can see is just another lemon tree","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"36","start":152.32,"end":155.32,"text":"I'm turning my head up and down","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"37","start":155.69,"end":158.69,"text":"I'm turning, turning, turning, turning, turning around","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"38","start":158.73,"end":161.73,"text":"And all that I can see is just another lemon tree","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"39","start":163.64,"end":165.56,"text":"And I wonder, wonder","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"40","start":165.56,"end":167.16,"text":"I wonder how","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"41","start":167.16,"end":168.64,"text":"I wonder why","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"42","start":168.64,"end":171.64,"text":"Yesterday you told me 'bout the blue, blue sky","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"43","start":171.92000000000002,"end":174.92000000000002,"text":"And all that I can see","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"44","start":175.21,"end":178.21,"text":"And all that I can see (ah, dip, dip, dip)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"45","start":178.52,"end":181.16,"text":"And all that I can see","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"46","start":181.16,"end":184.16,"text":"Is just a yellow lemon tree","translation":"","kind":"lyric"}],"candidates":[]}